5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin by observing everyone's behavior. Since it is the first day, we have no concrete information, so I suggest we focus on how each person communicates.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"That sounds like a plan, Asuka! I'm looking forward to seeing everyone's true colors come out. Let's keep things lively and see who's hiding something, shall we?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I'm going to be a super detective and find the werewolf! Let's make this a big adventure!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere and observe the flow of conversation. It's too early for accusations, so we should focus on establishing a baseline for everyone's behavior.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A baseline is a reasonable start. I'll be watching closely to see who deviates from their pattern. Let's see if anyone's ""lively"" nature is just a mask for something else.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, @Rin, your energy is noted, but let's ensure it doesn't cloud our judgment. @Shion, I agree that identifying deviations in behavior will be key as the game progresses.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! A little energy makes the game more fun, don't you think? I promise to keep my eyes wide open while I'm enjoying myself. Who's next to share their thoughts?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,I'm keeping my eyes wide open too! I bet the werewolf is trying to act all normal right now. I'll catch you if you're being sneaky! Who do you think looks the most suspicious so far?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, it is far too early to determine who is suspicious. We have only spoken for a few minutes. Let's avoid jumping to conclusions and instead listen to how everyone responds to the current situation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,@Minako is correct. Jumping to conclusions now is merely guessing. I'm more interested in how people react to the pressure of being observed. Let's see who starts to feel uneasy first.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have established a general approach for today. Since we are all in agreement that observation is the priority, I don't have anything further to add at this moment.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"I'm with Asuka on that. I've had my fun for now, so I'll settle down and watch you all. Let's see who's actually paying attention!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm paying attention! I'm paying the most attention of everyone! I'll be watching every single word you say, so don't try to trick me!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip!""}]}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Since we have reached a consensus on our approach for Day 0, I believe we can move toward concluding the discussion. Let's remain patient and wait for the Seer's first lead tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,I agree. There is no profit in further speculation today. I'll spend the rest of the time analyzing your patterns.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
