32,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We have reached the first day of voting. I have information to share. I am the Seer, and I divined Shion last night. Shion is human.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"Wow, Asuka! Coming out as the Seer right away? That's a bold move. I'm impressed by your confidence! So, Shion is safe for now? That certainly narrows things down.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, Asuka is the Seer! That's so cool! Does that mean Shion is definitely a good guy? I'm going to trust you, Asuka! Now we just have to find the sneaky werewolf!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, revealing yourself so early is a high-risk strategy, but it provides us with a clear starting point. If we trust your claim, we can focus our suspicions on the remaining three of us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a very efficient move. By clearing me, you've simplified the board. Now the question is whether you are truly the Seer or a werewolf attempting to secure an ally by granting me ""immunity.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your skepticism is logical, but if I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role to clear a random player would be an inefficient use of my reveal. I've provided a fact; now we must analyze the others.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're always so analytical! It's almost scary. But @Asuka's move was so flashy, it's hard not to believe her. If we assume she's telling the truth, who among us looks the most ""wolfy"" to you all?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I think May is being a little too excited! @May, you're asking who looks ""wolfy"" so quickly! Maybe you're trying to get us to point fingers at someone else so you can hide? Hehe, just kidding! Or am I?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, please refrain from making accusations based on ""feelings"" or jokes. It only creates noise. If we accept Asuka's claim, we should look for contradictions in how the rest of us respond to this new information.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, you're right about the noise. However, @Rin's ""joke"" is an interesting reaction. It's a common tactic to deflect suspicion by playing the role of the innocent observer. I'm curious to see how May responds to that.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, @May, please focus. We cannot afford to waste time on jokes. If Shion and I are human, the werewolf is among May, Rin, or Minako. I want to know if any of you have noticed anything inconsistent in our behavior.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're putting a lot of pressure on us! I've been nothing but supportive. If anything, @Minako is being a bit too quiet and clinical, don't you think? It's almost like she's trying too hard to be the ""voice of reason.""","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're pointing at Minako now! That's a big jump! But @Asuka is right, we have to be super careful. If the werewolf is hiding, they're probably pretending to be the smartest person here!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@May, being clinical is simply my nature. Using my personality as evidence of guilt is a weak argument. If we are to be logical, we should examine why you are suddenly attempting to shift the focus toward me.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@May, your attempt to frame Minako's personality as suspicious is quite transparent. It's a classic diversion. @Minako's logic is consistent, whereas your sudden shift in target is far more interesting. Are you feeling the pressure, May?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@May, your attempt to deflect suspicion onto Minako based on her personality is illogical. @Shion's observation is correct; your sudden shift in target is a common diversionary tactic. I am leaning toward voting for May.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"@Asuka, @Shion, you're both ganging up on me! I was just trying to keep the conversation interesting. Since when is being a bit playful a crime? I'm just a villager who likes a good game!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're sounding really nervous now! Everyone is starting to think you're the werewolf! I don't want to be mean, but if the Seer says so, I have to follow the clues! I'm voting for May!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@May, your defense is based on emotion rather than logic. When questioned, you've relied on your ""playful"" nature to excuse a sudden accusation. Given the current flow, May is the most suspicious. I will vote for May.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The consensus is overwhelming. Your defense is purely emotional, May, and your attempt to deflect onto Minako was a clumsy mistake. Logic dictates that you are the most likely candidate for the werewolf. I'll join the majority.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
